Just focus on the side
he chooses to show her.

00:22:25.574 --> 00:22:27.851
Everyone has both good and bad in them.

00:22:27.851 --> 00:22:30.272
If he's good to her, isn't that enough?

00:22:30.272 --> 00:22:32.672
But Eva doesn't see it that way.

00:22:32.672 --> 00:22:34.083
Then that's her problem.

00:22:34.083 --> 00:22:35.704
I'm done. She can figure it out herself.

00:22:35.704 --> 00:22:37.341
Pat, wait!

00:22:38.995 --> 00:22:41.600
If you know anything that...

00:22:42.547 --> 00:22:44.022
Yeah, yeah.

00:22:44.022 --> 00:22:47.184
If I hear anything, I'll let you know.

00:22:47.184 --> 00:22:48.566
I'd better go check on my girl.

00:22:48.566 --> 00:22:50.422
I wonder how far she's gotten into character.

00:22:50.422 --> 00:22:52.097
Pie, darling.

00:22:53.360 --> 00:22:58.324
Next time, I'm not taking another period drama
for a Gen Z kid like you.

00:23:03.459 --> 00:23:06.510
What did Domino ask you about?

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:08.875
Was it about me and Weechai?

00:23:08.875 --> 00:23:10.214
Yeah.

00:23:10.948 --> 00:23:15.015
But she really did ask
about you and Eva doing an event together.

00:23:15.015 --> 00:23:16.960
If we do an event together,

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:20.160
it'll just make us look
like future sisters-in-law.

00:23:20.768 --> 00:23:23.563
I know, I already told her
that you won't do it.

00:23:23.563 --> 00:23:26.267
Because you'll both be campaigning
for him together.

00:23:26.267 --> 00:23:27.786
Nope.

00:23:28.872 --> 00:23:30.638
I'm not doing it.

00:23:30.638 --> 00:23:33.480
I'm not going unless Weechai comes
and clears this up himself.

00:23:35.806 --> 00:23:39.062
Let me ask you something.

00:23:39.062 --> 00:23:42.163
Has he been sneaking around like this
ever since you started dating,

00:23:42.163 --> 00:23:43.691
or is this something new?

00:23:43.691 --> 00:23:46.827
Come on, he owns a nightclub.

00:23:46.827 --> 00:23:49.160
Of course. He's always surrounded by women.

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:51.961
I suppose it happens sometimes.

00:23:52.963 --> 00:23:57.240
But hooking up with some random woman
while we were still at the event,

00:23:57.859 --> 00:24:00.680
I think it was strange.

00:24:02.659 --> 00:24:04.640
It doesn't seem
like something Weechai would do.

00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:21.760
[Weechana's Assistant]

00:24:34.571 --> 00:24:37.984
- Hello.
- Hello, Domino.

00:24:37.984 --> 00:24:40.800
Did you leave your AirPods
at Mr. Weechana's place the other day?

00:24:40.800 --> 00:24:43.320
He said I should ask you about it.

00:24:45.576 --> 00:24:48.339
I'm not sure.

00:24:49.635 --> 00:24:50.870
I don't think so.

00:24:50.870 --> 00:24:55.880
I've been busy all day,
so I haven't gotten around to checking yet.

00:24:56.558 --> 00:24:58.888
I think it might be yours.

00:24:58.888 --> 00:25:01.848
There is "Domino" engraved on it,

00:25:01.848 --> 00:25:05.171
and it was found near Mr. Weechana's office.

00:25:05.171 --> 00:25:06.990
What about this?

00:25:06.990 --> 00:25:08.679
I'll send you a picture.

00:25:08.679 --> 00:25:12.974
If it is yours, just let me know,
and I'll have someone bring them over.

00:25:12.974 --> 00:25:14.775
Okay, thanks.

00:25:21.160 --> 00:25:24.280
[Domino]

00:25:40.750 --> 00:25:43.120
I've just had a lot on my mind lately.

00:25:44.446 --> 00:25:46.400
I've got so many things to deal with.

00:25:47.139 --> 00:25:50.400
Stress affects your body in so many ways.

00:25:51.072 --> 00:25:53.120
It keeps your nervous system on high alert,

00:25:53.120 --> 00:25:54.816
makes you breathe more shallowly,

00:25:54.816 --> 00:25:57.478
messes with your sleep,
and makes your muscles tighten up.

00:25:57.478 --> 00:26:00.000
It can even cause muscle cramps.

00:26:00.960 --> 00:26:02.290
Cramps.

00:26:03.134 --> 00:26:05.136
I thought you said crabs.

00:26:05.136 --> 00:26:06.585
That's "crabs".

00:26:06.585 --> 00:26:08.173
This is "cramps".

00:26:10.064 --> 00:26:12.965
And on top of that,
you're not getting enough protein.

00:26:14.100 --> 00:26:17.720
Have you been eating all the meals
I prepped for you?

00:26:20.344 --> 00:26:24.045
I haven't really been eating much lately.

00:26:26.743 --> 00:26:28.480
That hurts a little.

00:26:28.480 --> 00:26:30.168
What?

00:26:30.168 --> 00:26:31.240
Nothing.

00:26:31.240 --> 00:26:32.696
Yeah?

00:26:32.696 --> 00:26:34.220
It's nothing.

00:26:39.918 --> 00:26:44.366
You know, ever since I met you,

00:26:45.656 --> 00:26:47.960
I don't think
I've ever really seen you happy.

00:26:49.371 --> 00:26:52.811
You have everything a person could ask for,

00:26:52.811 --> 00:26:54.720
but you only seem to have two modes.

00:26:55.355 --> 00:26:58.798
Fierce and stressed.

00:26:58.798 --> 00:27:00.712
And...

00:27:00.712 --> 00:27:03.120
it takes so much energy
to be like that all the time.

00:27:04.083 --> 00:27:06.835
If you could just let your guard down

00:27:06.835 --> 00:27:08.963
and be the sweet person you really are,

00:27:08.963 --> 00:27:11.320
I think you'd have a lot more energy.

00:27:22.558 --> 00:27:25.100
My life's been so chaotic lately.

00:27:26.574 --> 00:27:29.222
Everything's just so complicated.

00:27:29.222 --> 00:27:32.360
You can't expect me not to be fierce
or lose my temper sometimes.

00:27:35.802 --> 00:27:39.154
Besides, when have you ever seen me
being all sweet?

00:27:40.443 --> 00:27:44.699
Well... when you talked to your aunt.

00:27:44.699 --> 00:27:48.720
I wasn't trying to eavesdrop.
I just couldn't help overhearing.

00:27:56.742 --> 00:27:58.543
Eva.

00:27:59.675 --> 00:28:01.476
You need more friends.

00:28:02.342 --> 00:28:06.827
You could use more friends like Domino.

00:28:06.827 --> 00:28:09.384
You need someone you can open up to.

00:28:09.384 --> 00:28:11.806
When life gets complicated

00:28:11.806 --> 00:28:14.120
and the weight you're carrying
becomes too heavy,

00:28:14.800 --> 00:28:16.601
that's what friends are for.

00:28:22.558 --> 00:28:24.200
Can you help me get up?

00:28:24.200 --> 00:28:25.219
Are you still hurt?

00:28:25.219 --> 00:28:27.900
Of course it hurts! Everything's cramping up.

00:28:29.726 --> 00:28:31.202
Easy.

00:28:52.608 --> 00:28:54.720
I'm back.

00:28:59.374 --> 00:29:01.880
How was your training?

00:29:01.880 --> 00:29:04.302
She hasn't been eating
all the meals I prepared for her.

00:29:04.302 --> 00:29:05.907
You're a snitch.

00:29:05.907 --> 00:29:08.894
You'll cramp up again.
You sure? It's gonna hurt.

00:29:08.894 --> 00:29:10.695
I don't care.

00:29:24.392 --> 00:29:26.659
Okay, fine.

00:29:26.659 --> 00:29:29.550
Please learn your lines
for pages 20 through 24 by tomorrow.

00:29:29.550 --> 00:29:31.800
And make sure you get enough protein.

00:29:33.259 --> 00:29:35.060
Please?

00:29:44.328 --> 00:29:46.830
Pun, let me walk you out.

00:29:46.830 --> 00:29:48.184
Sure.

00:29:48.184 --> 00:29:49.985
I'll be right back.

00:29:54.763 --> 00:29:58.280
- Let me get that for you.
- Thanks.

00:30:06.860 --> 00:30:09.880
- Hey, Pun.
- Yeah?

00:30:11.926 --> 00:30:15.120
Actually, please keep some distance
from Eva...

00:30:16.523 --> 00:30:19.707
while she's helping Weechana
with his campaign.

00:30:19.707 --> 00:30:23.280
I don't want any more photos
like the running ones.

00:30:24.699 --> 00:30:27.720
I've been told to be careful about it.

00:30:28.390 --> 00:30:31.320
Were you told or threatened?

00:30:33.403 --> 00:30:35.204
I was threatened.

00:30:38.422 --> 00:30:40.630
And...

00:30:40.630 --> 00:30:42.960
did Eva know about this?

00:30:42.960 --> 00:30:45.227
Eva was threatened as well.

00:30:50.161 --> 00:30:51.342
Sir?

00:30:51.342 --> 00:30:55.379
Domino has read your message,
but she hasn't replied yet.

00:30:56.371 --> 00:30:59.560
I think it most likely belongs to her.

00:31:01.995 --> 00:31:05.227
When you told her where it was found,
what did she say?

00:31:05.227 --> 00:31:08.320
She just went quiet. She didn't say anything.

00:31:09.379 --> 00:31:12.067
What should we do?

00:31:16.872 --> 00:31:21.080
The security cameras caught Domino
heading to the restroom.

00:31:22.984 --> 00:31:25.920
A few moments later, Eva followed her.

00:31:27.544 --> 00:31:30.220
But there are no cameras outside the restroom

00:31:30.220 --> 00:31:32.720
or in the hallway leading to my room,

00:31:32.720 --> 00:31:36.650
we can't be sure whether they saw anything.

00:31:38.315 --> 00:31:42.920
So, what does your instinct tell you?

00:31:46.219 --> 00:31:49.536
I think she and Eva were hiding there.

00:31:49.536 --> 00:31:52.683
If they hadn't seen something,

00:31:52.683 --> 00:31:54.566
they wouldn't have had any reason to hide.

00:31:54.566 --> 00:31:55.926
Right?

00:31:59.220 --> 00:32:01.328
Just watch them closely.

00:32:01.328 --> 00:32:04.150
But nothing can go wrong right now.

00:32:04.150 --> 00:32:05.951
Got it, sir.

00:32:22.190 --> 00:32:24.852
Oh, it looks good.

00:32:24.852 --> 00:32:26.653
Nice.

00:32:45.328 --> 00:32:47.115
Tutor's order.

00:32:48.027 --> 00:32:49.760
Breaking news from the police.

00:32:49.760 --> 00:32:51.133
A man's body was found

00:32:51.133 --> 00:32:54.187
floating in the Chao Phraya River
about 30 minutes ago.

00:32:54.187 --> 00:32:55.510
According to initial police investigation,

00:32:55.510 --> 00:32:58.859
the deceased has been identified as
38-year-old Thanwa Kittiwat,

00:32:58.859 --> 00:33:03.150
a political journalist
known for his news coverage and commentary

00:33:03.150 --> 00:33:05.067
in support of the New Progressive Party,

00:33:05.067 --> 00:33:08.680
the main rival of the Ruam Thai Chana Party.

00:33:13.160 --> 00:33:15.334
How dare you! How dare you do this to me?

00:33:15.334 --> 00:33:17.135
You want a piece of me?

00:33:22.163 --> 00:33:28.264
Seriously, Eva's boyfriend is a big shot
in the party.

00:33:28.264 --> 00:33:31.824
That party's starting to look
more and more like the mafia.

00:33:31.824 --> 00:33:33.680
What do you mean?

00:33:33.680 --> 00:33:35.547
You hear about it in the news all the time.

00:33:35.547 --> 00:33:37.168
Anyone who goes up against that party

00:33:37.168 --> 00:33:39.574
always seems to end up getting into trouble.

00:33:39.574 --> 00:33:41.600
And now this journalist.

00:33:42.395 --> 00:33:45.403
Who knows if he really took his own life?

00:33:45.403 --> 00:33:47.760
- What?
- Yeah.

00:33:47.760 --> 00:33:49.561
Seriously?

00:33:51.323 --> 00:33:53.880
I think you're exaggerating.
It can't be that bad.

00:33:54.763 --> 00:33:57.440
This is Thailand, man.

00:33:57.440 --> 00:34:00.635
How could you not know about this?

00:34:01.241 --> 00:34:03.042
No way.

00:34:16.811 --> 00:34:20.872
Can you stir up some trouble before midnight?

00:34:20.872 --> 00:34:23.112
Make it big enough

00:34:23.112 --> 00:34:25.720
that nobody's paying attention
to anything else.

00:34:53.836 --> 00:34:55.560
You son of a bitch!

00:34:57.942 --> 00:34:59.811
You said you had it under control!

00:34:59.811 --> 00:35:01.480
So how the hell did the body turn up?

00:35:01.480 --> 00:35:03.789
Sir, please calm down. Let me check first.

00:35:03.789 --> 00:35:06.520
- My people...
- Your people?

00:35:12.397 --> 00:35:13.848
Sir, please.

00:35:13.848 --> 00:35:15.494
Please, calm down.

00:35:15.494 --> 00:35:18.635
I will take care of it.
I'll make a call right now.

00:35:18.635 --> 00:35:20.566
Your people?

00:35:20.566 --> 00:35:24.567
You piece of shit! What the hell did you do?

00:35:24.567 --> 00:35:26.744
You asshole!

00:35:26.744 --> 00:35:28.781
You stupid son of a bitch!

00:35:29.554 --> 00:35:32.462
Damn you, fucking idiot!

00:35:32.462 --> 00:35:34.760
You're stupid as fuck!

00:35:36.216 --> 00:35:38.699
Do you think he has that in him?

00:35:38.699 --> 00:35:39.904
What do you mean?

00:35:39.904 --> 00:35:42.798
To have it in him
to do something so horrifying.

00:35:42.798 --> 00:35:45.142
Whoa! What are you trying to say?

00:35:45.142 --> 00:35:46.942
Dude, don't creep me out.

00:35:46.942 --> 00:35:48.854
My heart can't take this.

00:35:48.854 --> 00:35:52.840
Domino just told me Eva was threatened too.

00:35:53.736 --> 00:35:55.048
The same way he threatened us?

00:35:55.048 --> 00:35:56.984
I'm not sure about that.

00:35:56.984 --> 00:36:00.051
But even Eva was threatened.

00:36:00.051 --> 00:36:01.952
Goddamn!

00:36:03.235 --> 00:36:07.800
Are you sure he knew we saw him?

00:36:08.544 --> 00:36:10.124
Yeah.

00:36:12.120 --> 00:36:15.960
His assistant called me today
and told me where my item had been found.

00:36:15.960 --> 00:36:19.320
It was almost like he was testing me
to see if I'd slip up.

00:36:19.320 --> 00:36:21.960
I think he's definitely onto us now.

00:36:27.771 --> 00:36:33.080
Sometimes I get so tired of my children
and grandchildren's incompetence.

00:36:33.832 --> 00:36:36.142
At my age,

00:36:36.142 --> 00:36:38.500
I should be able to slow down and enjoy life.

00:36:39.763 --> 00:36:42.765
Then tomorrow,
pack your things and move in with me.

00:36:42.765 --> 00:36:44.645
No!

00:36:44.645 --> 00:36:48.643
If I move in with you,
you could end up in danger.

00:36:48.643 --> 00:36:51.192
I'm scared too.
But we can't abandon each other.

00:36:51.192 --> 00:36:53.715
I can't let you go anywhere by yourself.

00:36:53.715 --> 00:36:55.989
At the very least, you've got me.

00:36:55.989 --> 00:36:58.520
I don't think
Weechana would dare do anything to me.

00:36:59.448 --> 00:37:04.760
Don't forget,
he still needs my help with his campaign.

00:37:04.760 --> 00:37:07.300
As long as you stay close to me,
you'll be safe.

00:37:07.982 --> 00:37:10.904
Do you really think you can break up with him
after this?

00:37:10.904 --> 00:37:13.600
What if he finds out how much we know?

00:37:16.350 --> 00:37:18.792
I don't know.

00:37:18.792 --> 00:37:21.850
For now, we just have to play it cool.

00:37:22.973 --> 00:37:24.728
You need to stay calm, okay?

00:37:24.728 --> 00:37:28.240
Use every acting trick you've learned
in show business.

00:37:30.467 --> 00:37:32.939
As for that video of me arguing with him...

00:37:32.939 --> 00:37:34.096
You're a nobody!

00:37:34.096 --> 00:37:36.336
You need to help me with my campaign.

00:37:36.336 --> 00:37:38.107
Make sure you save it.

00:37:38.107 --> 00:37:40.640
You'll need to make two copies
on separate flash drives

00:37:40.640 --> 00:37:41.771
and keep them in different places.

00:37:41.771 --> 00:37:43.499
Upload another copy to the cloud.

00:37:43.499 --> 00:37:46.400
Then wipe it completely from your phone.

00:37:46.400 --> 00:37:48.201
Keep the team ready.

00:37:49.700 --> 00:37:52.200
If things go south,

00:37:55.205 --> 00:37:57.413
I'll handle it myself.

00:37:57.413 --> 00:37:59.280
Yes, ma'am.

00:38:04.139 --> 00:38:06.320
One more thing.

00:38:06.320 --> 00:38:08.715
I think we need someone

00:38:08.715 --> 00:38:11.100
who knows everything
that's been happening to us.

00:38:12.768 --> 00:38:17.771
So I decided to tell Domino
that we'd been threatened too.

00:38:17.771 --> 00:38:20.600
Dude, that was even worse.

00:38:21.334 --> 00:38:23.710
I already told someone.

00:38:23.710 --> 00:38:27.359
He had been threatened too.

00:38:27.360 --> 00:38:28.780
Who?

00:38:29.800 --> 00:38:32.119
Pun.

00:38:32.120 --> 00:38:33.763
I feel bad for them.

00:38:33.763 --> 00:38:36.830
They're just two tiny and helpless women.

00:38:36.830 --> 00:38:39.448
How the hell are they supposed
to take on anyone?

00:38:39.449 --> 00:38:41.250
Don't worry.

00:38:42.000 --> 00:38:44.114
We won't leave them behind.